# Accounts, cloud save and friends.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill both values in from your Supabase
# project (Dashboard -> Project Settings -> API). Run supabase/schema.sql in
# that project's SQL editor first, or the app will sign in and then fail to
# read anything.
#
# Both values are compiled into the bundle and ship inside the APK. That is
# how Supabase is meant to be used: the anon key is public, and the row-level
# security policies in supabase/schema.sql are what actually keep one player
# out of another's data. NEVER put the service_role key here — it bypasses
# every policy.
#
# A build with these left empty still works: it plays entirely offline, with
# no gate and no friends, and says so in Settings.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key
